<span id="cb5-5"><a href="#cb5-5" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="fu">log</span>(DeflatedHits)   <span class="sc">-</span><span class="fl">0.456</span>      <span class="fl">0.277</span>   <span class="sc">-</span><span class="fl">1.64</span>   <span class="fl">0.1001</span></span></code></pre></div>
<p>把全部 4 个命中变量放进来后，3 个进入模型并显著：</p>
