<p><img alt="15 个代表产品的预估生存曲线（AdSense、Scholar、Voice 等）" data-aspect-ratio="333 / 221" decoding="async" height="442" id="_R0PtZx9J" loading="lazy" src="/images/google/15-predicted-survivorship-curves.png" width="666"></img></p>
